  "canon:pmid": "11419773",
  "canon:title": "Caffeine-induced cardiac arrhythmia: an unrecognised danger of healthfood products.",
  "canon:abstract": "We describe a 25-year-old woman with pre-existing mitral valve prolapse who developed intractable ventricular fibrillation after consuming a \"natural energy\" guarana health drink containing a high concentration of caffeine. This case highlights the need for adequate labelling and regulation of such products.",
  "canon:text": "Caffeine-induced cardiac arrhythmia: an unrecognised danger of healthfood products. We describe a 25-year-old woman with pre-existing mitral valve prolapse who developed intractable ventricular fibrillation after consuming a \"natural energy\" guarana health drink containing a high concentration of caffeine. This case highlights the need for adequate labelling and regulation of such products.",
